                  "text": "AMS 5630"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Stainless Steel Grade: 440C"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Product Forms: Steel, Corrosion-Resistant, Bars, Wire, and Forgings"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Application: Typically specified for parts requiring hardness up to 58 HRC and resistance to wear, corrosion, and oxidation."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Product availability:"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "[Stainless Steel Grade 440C Round Bar](https://titanium.com/shop/products/mill-products-stainless-steel-round-bar)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "DISCLAIMER: The use of this information should be considered strictly voluntary. Information contained in this page or across the domain, may contain typographical errors and are for reference only. Information presented are purely generalizations and are not a substitution for AMS specifications."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "DISCLAIMER: Alloy data sheets are for reference only, not for design purposes."
                },
